<title>USA: Binks stake cut by Tweedy, Browne group.</title>
<headline>Binks stake cut by Tweedy, Browne group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Tweedy, Browne Company L.P. said Monday it lowered its stake in Binks Manufacturing Co to 105,766 common shares or 3.42 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net 87,590 common sold between November 5 and December 18. The filing did not give a price per share breakdown.</p>
<p>Binks, a spray finishing and coating equipment manufacturer is based in Franklin Park, Illinois.</p>
</text>
